msgid "required (=2) -- enforced for MLD"
msgstr "必需（=2）——MLD 强制启用"

msgid "mlo=0 -- disabled"
msgstr "mlo=0 —— 已禁用"

msgid "Enable MLO (switch to multi-link)"
msgstr "启用 MLO（切换到多链路）"

msgid "Disable MLO (switch to single-band)"
msgstr "禁用 MLO（切换到单频段）"

msgid "Country and sku_idx must always be written together and apply to all 3 radios. Country change requires a full reboot -- wifi restart is not sufficient."
msgstr "country 和 sku_idx 必须始终同时写入，并应用到全部 3 个频段。更改国家/地区需要完整重启，仅重启 WiFi 不够。"

msgid "skip channel survey -- disabling may cause slow restart (2-3 min) and channel width reduction"
msgstr "跳过信道扫描——禁用后可能导致重启缓慢（2–3 分钟）并降低信道宽度"

